    "notes": "Countdown type with the countdown inside one story (numbers left for Early Five) so a muted viewer always knows the stake. Real Bhai Dooj scene: sisters doing tilak on video call is what half the gang will do on 11 Nov. Claim before reveal: Myra is happy feeding laddoo, the gang suffers; the drop is the brother winning it for her. Twist is see-it: his chat bubbles on the call. The brother never speaks (no male voice), only his chat shows. Rewrite 1: first draft had a separate 3-2-1 list of Bhai Dooj habits, unclear and no story; folded into one game. Endings tried: brother asks for half the prize (money joke, cut), Myra keeps the prize as shagun and gives nothing (weaker), the gang calls their own brothers with Myra's opening Ruko line (kept, loops to the start). Lead is Myra since the last reel led with Tanya. Two lines a shot, pace 28 for the QA pace check."
